Courier Charge Optimization
Algorithm
1. Start.
2. Enter parcel weight, length, width, height, distance, urgency, and restriction.
3. Validate the parcel dimensions and weight.
4. Calculate delivery charges for standard and express services.
5. Check which services are eligible for the parcel.
6. Compare the charges and select the cheapest eligible service.
7. Display the charges and selected service.
8. Stop.
